  "2026-11-28T02:12:27.653Z",codex-agent,"Verified the wrapper discards the published checker exit code after link validation. Keep link validation and delegated diagnostics and return the checker result, including strict pending checks."
  "2026-11-28T02:25:46.995Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert kept the new dependency and tests but restored the original wrapper. The pending-only default check returned 1 where the test required 0. After restoration the linked wrapper suite passed all 20 tests, including read-only pending acceptance, strict pending rejection and versioned drift rejection."
  "2026-11-28T02:25:51.038Z",codex-agent,"Typecheck, test typecheck, docstrings and lint passed. Regenerate and check the changelog after releasing this claim. Exact-head CI is tracked at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/actions?query=branch%3Afix%2Fchangelog-wrapper-pending-check."
  "2026-11-28T02:28:53.410Z",codex-agent,"The repository Git identity and privacy gate reports zero violations. The supplementary tracker identity test fails identically on main commit 379abdd and on this branch for the existing duplicate importer identity unbraind/pm-review#57. Follow-up: pm-review-d4u9."
